<https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-X01> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An instituted, identifiable subject of enterprise-risk analysis and tracking. It persists across its descriptions, reassessments, responsibilities and administrative record states under a governed identity policy. It is neither its register entry nor a scenario specification nor an actual occurrence." .
